      "title": {
        "en": "Skilled deshedding and breed-standard cuts"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Dog owners celebrate the visual quality of grooming services, praising thorough deshedding, dematting, and stylish scissor work on various breeds. While one client was upset when their golden retriever was shaved instead of trimmed, the vast majority note that pets leave looking adorable, clean, and styled according to owner photos."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affectionate care for anxious and small dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers repeatedly note that their dogs show genuine excitement when arriving at the salon. Pet parents of anxious toy poodles, young puppies, and rescue dogs emphasize that the groomers handle animals with gentle patience and give them plenty of cuddles, making nervous pets feel completely safe and relaxed."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Friendly team and responsive booking"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients speak warmly of groomer Ben and the salon team, praising their friendly attitudes and clear communication via text messaging. Although one reviewer criticised staff for failing to acknowledge a styling error, most pet owners describe a receptive, trustworthy team that consistently delivers dependable customer care."
      }
    }
  ],
